   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Owen. You're verified, and I've pulled up order Q-7601 from Pho Real.\n\nThe records show two beef pho on the order, delivered at 6:41 PM, and the courier's log shows one handoff with no record of a missing item. I'm sorry one bowl didn't make it. I can compensate the missing beef pho in one of two ways:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242:** $12.00. The order had a $10 WELCOME10 promo, and the pho's share of that discount ($3.00) comes off the $15.00 price.\n2. **Account credit:** $18.00 for use on future Forkful orders. That's the $15.00 item price plus 20%.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "I'd prefer the refund to my card, please. The welcome promo was a while ago and I don't remember the exact amount, so I'm not sure about the $3 math, but I just want the pho money back on my Visa."
