  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've refunded $12.00 for the missing beef pho to your Visa ending 4242. It should appear within 3 to 5 business days. Refund reference: RF-4000.\n\nAbout the math: the $15.00 pho price minus $3.00 for its share of your WELCOME10 discount is $12.00. The discount was $10.00 on a $50.00 subtotal, so each dollar of the subtotal got 20 cents of it. Your spring rolls and banh mi were delivered, so nothing else on this order needs compensating.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for sorting that out. I'll watch for the $12 on my Visa over the next few days. Appreciate the help, Owen. Have a good one."
